WEBVTT

00:09.870 --> 00:11.360
Val!

00:14.280 --> 00:16.040
Red Dragon...

00:16.040 --> 00:18.750
Everyone believed in you...

00:18.750 --> 00:22.750
That you would fight alongside the revolutionary army.

00:22.750 --> 00:25.520
But instead, you're going to kill us?

00:28.120 --> 00:30.360
At the core of the first expedition

00:30.360 --> 00:34.130
was Izun, a Bound One bonded with a gargantuan Stone Giant.

00:34.130 --> 00:39.120
Our fate was sealed the moment he fell so easily.

00:43.270 --> 00:44.760
Izun!

00:46.880 --> 00:48.740
Izun, what are you trying to tell me...?

00:48.740 --> 00:51.140
Stop it! Don't die!

01:07.300 --> 01:11.160
Red Dragon will not save us...

01:12.170 --> 01:15.070
The name of our country is Nil Kamui.

01:15.070 --> 01:17.310
It's a small island country.

01:17.310 --> 01:22.110
The covetous, great ancient country of Kouran conducted a sudden invasion

01:22.110 --> 01:25.180
and plundered a third of the land.

01:25.180 --> 01:28.280
Our ally, the great country to the east, D'natia,

01:28.280 --> 01:32.320
defended settlements where they had their bases, then kept silent.

01:32.320 --> 01:35.290
The two great countries quickly carved away Nil Kamui's lands

01:35.290 --> 01:39.830
like meat from a sacrificial swine.

01:39.830 --> 01:43.160
The island's guardian deity,
Red Dragon, suddenly went mad

01:43.160 --> 01:46.600
and began indiscriminately burning villages and killing people.

01:48.100 --> 01:51.110
Imperial Era 3015, September...

01:51.110 --> 01:55.280
Our country was no longer ours.

01:55.280 --> 02:00.050
<i>The heat-haze shimmers, ember-toned</i>

02:00.050 --> 02:04.490
<i>Its blurred afterimage far away</i>

02:04.490 --> 02:06.610
<i>(I'm back in this life)</i>

02:17.400 --> 02:26.740
<i>My shout added to the noise</i> <i>and disappeared into the chaos</i>

02:26.740 --> 02:27.740
<i>(Don't wait)</i>

02:27.740 --> 02:29.840
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

02:29.840 --> 02:32.910
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

02:32.910 --> 02:35.150
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

02:35.150 --> 02:37.350
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

02:37.350 --> 02:41.590
<i>Defiling even this chosen fate</i>

02:41.590 --> 02:47.830
<i>With the blood of judgment</i>

02:47.830 --> 02:53.330
<i>"If I can just solve this unraveling</i> <i>moment with my own hands"</i>

02:53.330 --> 02:58.410
<i>I howled enough to burn my life out</i>

02:58.410 --> 03:04.080
<i>I left my hopes to an</i> <i>undependable past and vanished</i>

03:04.080 --> 03:09.680
<i>Cruelly enough, my voice was beautiful</i>

03:09.680 --> 03:13.720
<i>The ending world</i>

03:13.720 --> 03:18.590
<i>I'll be a judgment light</i>

03:25.970 --> 03:28.960
"Nil Kamui \ Haiga \ Ka Grava's manor"

03:29.600 --> 03:33.210
Ah, now I know the meaning of this message.

03:33.210 --> 03:36.870
Back then, Red's predecessor told me this...

03:42.980 --> 03:44.820
Friend...

03:44.820 --> 03:49.260
There will come a day when I am greatly changed from how I have been in the past.

03:49.260 --> 03:52.590
No... It will be worse than that.

03:52.590 --> 03:54.560
What do you mean?

03:54.560 --> 03:59.470
When this comes to pass, can you visit Ogani Volcano?

03:59.470 --> 04:06.570
That volcano will likely be the last place left where I can maintain my sense of reason.

04:08.240 --> 04:12.240
Are you trying to tell me that you'll leave something at Ogani Volcano?

04:35.040 --> 04:38.670
That was Red Dragon's message...?

04:38.670 --> 04:42.510
But back then, Red Dragon showed no sense of reason.

04:42.510 --> 04:47.310
I'll let you all decide whether you believe it or not.

04:54.320 --> 04:59.160
Hey, so where's the bath supposed to be?

05:00.830 --> 05:03.160
G-Gakusho?!

05:03.160 --> 05:05.470
Well, well...

05:05.470 --> 05:10.570
Kouran's stationing was agreed on, so I came right away to take a bath, but...

05:10.570 --> 05:13.840
Damn, this place is huge.

05:13.840 --> 05:15.580
I'll lead you there.

05:15.580 --> 05:17.910
Hurry up and follow me.

05:17.910 --> 05:21.320
Oh, a Mixed One? Looking cute there.

05:21.320 --> 05:22.840
I'll stab you.

05:25.590 --> 05:28.820
Is that the Leader of One Thousand,
General Gakusho?

05:32.530 --> 05:35.520
Kouran sure is diverse...

05:37.100 --> 05:40.170
Me, speak with General Gakusho?

05:40.170 --> 05:44.570
Yes, in regards to establishing coexistence between the forces here in Haiga.

05:44.570 --> 05:47.240
That is an important subject.

05:47.240 --> 05:50.550
But... isn't that your job as ambassador?

05:50.550 --> 05:53.520
Ah, well, about that...

05:55.350 --> 06:00.520
My Master only recently arrived in Nil Kamui, so he isn't aware of the situation here.

06:00.520 --> 06:02.850
Ah, yeah! That's it!

06:03.860 --> 06:07.630
I forgot that this all came together on Ka Grava's whim.

06:07.630 --> 06:09.120
Understood.

06:11.730 --> 06:15.100
Do your best, Ulrika!

06:18.440 --> 06:21.030
Sir Sweallow Clazzvali.

06:22.440 --> 06:24.540
Um, you're...?

06:26.050 --> 06:31.920
I am the military force's bishop,
Father Enumael Meschwitz.

06:31.920 --> 06:35.620
May I borrow you for a moment?

06:35.620 --> 06:38.060
Uh, sure...

06:42.400 --> 06:45.300
Damn, this feels great...

06:46.300 --> 06:49.470
So, why are you folks in here with me?

06:49.470 --> 06:53.270
They said this bath was open during the morning for the ladies, so...

06:53.270 --> 06:56.940
That wasn't what I was asking.

06:56.940 --> 06:59.950
Oh, come now, General Gakusho.

06:59.950 --> 07:02.850
I do believe I know your "tastes."

07:02.850 --> 07:06.950
I would be honored to become better acquainted with you...

07:06.950 --> 07:09.590
Lady Gakusho...

07:09.590 --> 07:12.990
Lady Kohkaku promoted me to my current position!

07:12.990 --> 07:14.490
Kohkaku...

07:16.700 --> 07:20.870
I heard a rumor that Lady
Kohkaku was finished off

07:20.870 --> 07:23.970
by someone from Kouran, not the revolutionary army.

07:23.970 --> 07:26.310
Impossible! That can't be!

07:26.310 --> 07:32.110
Lady Kohkaku was planning on exterminating
Red Dragon before the expedition.

07:32.110 --> 07:36.350
After what happened, I plan to carry out her will in her place.

07:36.350 --> 07:40.790
My main force will be heading out to Ogani Volcano tomorrow.

07:40.790 --> 07:42.790
Sorry, but that's that.

07:42.790 --> 07:45.490
It's not that I want to take a bath!

07:45.490 --> 07:49.500
But I was told to bring you in here!

07:49.500 --> 07:52.230
Wait! Don't touch my armor!

07:52.230 --> 07:54.800
But it'll rust! Right?

07:54.800 --> 07:56.290
There!

08:00.310 --> 08:03.010
Ah, so you're Ulrika.

08:03.010 --> 08:05.710
Um, Leader of One Thousand, Gakusho...?

08:05.710 --> 08:07.720
I asked for an unofficial meeting...

08:07.720 --> 08:11.750
Well, there's no better place than here, is there?

08:11.750 --> 08:14.690
But there are others here...

08:14.690 --> 08:18.430
You know they're part of the combined expedition, right?

08:18.430 --> 08:21.330
Sir Sweallow's party members?

08:21.330 --> 08:24.700
Why, yes, we're quite close.

08:30.070 --> 08:32.740
Notification was sent to Kouran and D'natia

08:32.740 --> 08:37.610
to withhold all military activity until the combined expedition finds Red Dragon.

08:37.610 --> 08:39.380
Why did you attack Haiga?

08:39.380 --> 08:43.950
Because rumor had it that Ka Grava was backing the revolutionary army.

08:43.950 --> 08:46.350
But it was just a misunderstanding.

08:46.350 --> 08:52.430
According to our pact, D'natia and Kouran won't conduct any battles in Haiga.

08:52.430 --> 08:54.530
Sounds okay, right?

08:54.530 --> 08:56.960
That's it for our unofficial meeting.

08:58.230 --> 08:59.300
Please wait.

08:59.300 --> 09:00.970
Huh?

09:00.970 --> 09:03.400
Moving forward, our countries' approach in Haiga should...

09:03.400 --> 09:06.770
C'mon, I'm not good with politics...

09:08.080 --> 09:10.040
Ah... I'm sorry.

09:10.040 --> 09:12.380
Well, well, if it isn't the Imperial.

09:12.380 --> 09:14.120
Imperial?

09:14.120 --> 09:16.080
So, he's part of the expedition?

09:17.120 --> 09:20.660
Excuse me. I was looking for Eykha, and...

09:20.660 --> 09:24.890
I was close to being assassinated by this kiddo here.

09:24.890 --> 09:26.630
N-Not at all!

09:26.630 --> 09:33.570
But, if that power you spoke of is real, don't ever use it again.

09:33.570 --> 09:37.770
Or is there something you want to gain, even if it means losing everything?

09:37.770 --> 09:39.140
I don't know...

09:39.140 --> 09:40.840
Honest, aren't you?

09:44.350 --> 09:46.250
Gakusho...

09:46.250 --> 09:49.840
The hostility she exhibited earlier is gone now...

09:54.990 --> 09:59.090
Sir Sweallow, what are you going to do with this?

09:59.090 --> 10:02.500
A power that can paint everything in black...

10:03.930 --> 10:07.270
It's called the "Black Dragon's Scale."

10:07.270 --> 10:08.770
It can't be!

10:08.770 --> 10:16.140
I heard alchemists created it from
D'natia's source of magic, Black Dragon.

10:16.140 --> 10:17.810
Black Dragon...

10:20.150 --> 10:23.550
Here in Nil Kamui, the power of the Black Dragon Knights

10:23.550 --> 10:27.820
and Kouran's magic aren't as effective as they are back in their homelands.

10:27.820 --> 10:29.520
You are aware of that, yes?

10:29.520 --> 10:33.060
Yeah, I heard about that before.

10:33.060 --> 10:36.900
Ever since coming to this island,
I haven't really been in my groove.

10:36.900 --> 10:41.500
That's because this land is greatly affected by Red Dragon's power.

10:41.500 --> 10:43.700
But...

10:43.700 --> 10:50.340
...with this single scale, the land's magical property will shift to that of Black Dragon.

10:50.340 --> 10:57.550
If used properly, this entire island can be placed under the power of Black Dragon.

10:57.550 --> 11:04.090
But this island's water, crops, and nature itself are harmonized through Red Dragon's power.

11:04.090 --> 11:06.190
If that is forcibly changed, then...

11:06.190 --> 11:10.560
That is something a mere attendant should not worry about.

11:10.560 --> 11:14.740
"If it is to defeat Red Dragon, its use can't be helped."

11:14.740 --> 11:17.770
So says our Emperor...

11:17.770 --> 11:21.010
So, it's our secret weapon to defeat Red Dragon?

11:21.010 --> 11:27.070
I have faith that you will lead
D'natia to a bright future.

11:29.780 --> 11:33.550
"Magic \ Magic is a systematic art which

11:29.780 --> 11:33.550
controls the world's energy through human will.

11:29.780 --> 11:33.550
Due to the nature of using will, training is

11:29.780 --> 11:33.550
often spiritualistic, and has a strong tendency

11:29.780 --> 11:33.550
to be relayed by word of mouth from

11:29.780 --> 11:33.550
master to disciple as in an apprenticeship."

11:36.190 --> 11:39.730
I'm going to Ogani Volcano.

11:39.730 --> 11:44.070
Does that mean you trust my information?

11:44.070 --> 11:45.230
Yes.

11:45.230 --> 11:49.700
I need to see Red Dragon as soon as possible.

11:49.700 --> 11:51.240
I'm sorry...

11:51.240 --> 11:52.940
If it's painful for you, Eykha, then...

11:52.940 --> 11:55.780
Ibuki, if that's how you feel, then I'll go too.

11:55.780 --> 11:59.410
I have no objections at all.

11:59.410 --> 12:03.550
If I have to use that scale, then this isn't something I want to move forward with...

12:03.550 --> 12:06.390
Is the good knight from D'natia in opposition?

12:06.390 --> 12:09.260
You need to go through the desert to get to Ogani Volcano, right?

12:09.260 --> 12:10.790
Danger is dangerous!

12:10.790 --> 12:15.660
Not to worry. We will accompany you to
Fort Rosweisse, situated near the volcano.

12:15.660 --> 12:18.500
Ah, uh... Okay...

12:18.500 --> 12:22.400
Good for you, gaining yet another beautiful companion.

12:22.400 --> 12:24.100
Meryl...

12:25.110 --> 12:27.740
Well then, it's settled.

12:27.740 --> 12:30.980
Can I leave the rest to you, Shaddy? Sol?

12:30.980 --> 12:32.150
Yes.

12:32.150 --> 12:34.280
Will you be accompanying us, Lord Ka Grava?

12:34.280 --> 12:36.980
Didn't I say Red Dragon was my friend?

12:36.980 --> 12:39.150
I can't turn my back on my friend in need.

12:39.150 --> 12:42.820
Besides, don't you folks have needs to cover?

12:42.820 --> 12:43.990
Oh!

12:43.990 --> 12:45.660
Thank you very much.

12:45.660 --> 12:49.430
But due to a certain someone, we will need plenty of dishware,

12:49.430 --> 12:52.170
so my company will prepare it.

12:52.170 --> 12:54.860
C'mon, Meryl...

13:04.450 --> 13:07.950
Is it okay, leaving General Gakusho behind?

13:07.950 --> 13:11.020
She isn't in Haiga anymore.

13:11.020 --> 13:14.290
It seems she headed to
Ogani Volcano with her associates.

13:14.290 --> 13:16.520
Well, isn't that a coincidence?

13:16.520 --> 13:20.490
As you know, I have little awareness of what the forces are up to.

13:20.490 --> 13:21.560
Where's Ibuki?

13:21.560 --> 13:24.400
He said something about wanting to speak with Ka Grava.

13:24.400 --> 13:25.900
I see.

13:25.900 --> 13:33.470
Ka Grava... Were my father and all the previous kings granted this power from Red Dragon?

13:33.470 --> 13:39.180
Hmm... So, your power lets you take one's life with the flames of a dragon

13:39.180 --> 13:44.020
by offering another one's life to the dragon?

13:44.020 --> 13:47.920
The offering must be someone who is precious to me...

13:47.920 --> 13:50.560
It seems to mean the life of a friend...

13:50.560 --> 13:54.500
Hmm... I've never heard of such a thing before.

13:54.500 --> 13:59.570
Is Red Dragon's lack of sanity the reason I've been cursed like this?

13:59.570 --> 14:03.200
History makes note of a certain king of the dead.

14:03.200 --> 14:04.840
King of the dead?

14:04.840 --> 14:12.680
The power that Imperial held allowed him to raise those he killed as Returned Ones.

14:12.680 --> 14:14.250
Returned Ones...!

14:14.250 --> 14:17.220
Those who come back from the dead to assault others?

14:17.220 --> 14:20.090
But that's just a legend...

14:20.090 --> 14:22.860
I haven't met any Returned Ones before.

14:22.860 --> 14:25.960
But legend says that those killed by the king of the dead

14:25.960 --> 14:30.730
will always rise as Returned Ones, forming a force said to be in the tens of thousands.

14:30.730 --> 14:34.200
Is that a power granted by Red Dragon, too?

14:34.200 --> 14:36.970
The dragons have the power to revive as many times as needed

14:36.970 --> 14:39.710
and the power to take the lives of others.

14:39.710 --> 14:45.480
Killing and reviving... I feel this is originally the same in power.

14:45.480 --> 14:50.580
If they're supposed to be the same,
I'd rather have the power of revival...

14:59.590 --> 15:03.230
Hey! This is supposed to be two days' worth of water for everyone!

15:03.230 --> 15:04.570
Sorry...

15:04.570 --> 15:07.770
I just wanted to have a drink with my own hands.

15:07.770 --> 15:10.740
Sir Sweallow's "just" is a matter of life or death.

15:10.740 --> 15:17.810
Hm, my Ka Grava Car has a bit of reserve, but most of the water was loaded there.

15:17.810 --> 15:22.650
If that's the case, I'll go on ahead to look for an oasis around the area.

15:22.650 --> 15:24.990
If you'd like, we can just meet up later.

15:24.990 --> 15:26.820
Are you okay going by yourself?

15:26.820 --> 15:28.120
Yes...

15:28.120 --> 15:29.780
Alone...

15:36.000 --> 15:38.470
Where are you headed, Lou?

15:38.470 --> 15:43.130
I won't let anyone get in the way of my offering Red Dragon to you, my lord.

15:51.150 --> 15:55.120
"Ogani Volcano \ Isolated village near the base"

15:54.010 --> 15:55.720
No more...!

15:55.720 --> 15:57.720
What's this about?

15:57.720 --> 16:04.560
We're not sure what happened, but many like him have come from the volcano.

16:04.560 --> 16:06.390
Returned Ones...

16:06.390 --> 16:08.960
They were... Returned Ones...

16:08.960 --> 16:12.330
They walked through the lava as if it was nothing!

16:13.630 --> 16:15.200
Returned Ones...?

16:15.200 --> 16:18.070
Do they really exist...?

16:18.070 --> 16:20.740
Question them and see if we can get information on Red Dragon.

16:20.740 --> 16:22.230
Yes!

16:39.530 --> 16:41.330
You...

16:41.330 --> 16:43.230
So, that's what you're looking for...

16:44.870 --> 16:48.070
Even if you're in debt to Kohkaku,

16:48.070 --> 16:52.740
there's no way a clear-headed person like yourself would willingly hunt Red Dragon.

16:52.740 --> 16:56.880
If so, this must be your "reason."

16:56.880 --> 17:01.220
Lady Kohkaku's research finally arrived from our homeland.

17:01.220 --> 17:03.410
The Gold Wedge.

17:05.020 --> 17:11.630
With that, we're supposed to be able to shift the land's magic property to that of Kouran.

17:11.630 --> 17:14.700
In other words, all magic besides that of Kouran,

17:14.700 --> 17:16.900
such as D'natia's and Nil Kamui's, will lose its power.

17:16.900 --> 17:19.070
Of course, Red Dragon as well...

17:19.070 --> 17:22.140
What a frightening item...

17:22.140 --> 17:23.970
If you want it, take it.

17:23.970 --> 17:26.270
Well then, I will.

17:26.270 --> 17:27.270
Wait.

17:27.270 --> 17:29.740
That alone won't do any good.

17:29.740 --> 17:31.230
Take this...!

17:32.410 --> 17:37.150
Just as rumored, I see you have no hesitation in assassinating even allies, Lou Chun Wah!

17:37.150 --> 17:42.450
I have no idea what you had planned, but you've made a mistake in killing my subordinate!

17:49.100 --> 17:51.430
That sword...

17:51.430 --> 17:53.470
Beautiful...

17:53.470 --> 17:54.840
Hand it over...!

17:54.840 --> 17:58.410
You have that rifle of yours.

17:58.410 --> 18:00.410
I don't want this...!

18:00.410 --> 18:03.570
That sword is mine...!

18:09.250 --> 18:12.990
It seems she had a counter skill ready.

18:12.990 --> 18:15.420
She diverted my strike by a bit.

18:15.420 --> 18:17.620
One more strike should finish her off!

18:17.620 --> 18:19.490
Let's not do this, Lou...

18:19.490 --> 18:21.630
She won't make it anyways.

18:21.630 --> 18:26.030
Leave her paltry soul... I'd rather you not let that female Black Dragon Knight get away.

18:26.030 --> 18:28.870
Black Dragon... Meaning Ulrika?

18:28.870 --> 18:33.170
Yes, I'm sure her soul is quite wonderful...

18:41.050 --> 18:42.480
Lady Gakusho!

18:42.480 --> 18:43.780
Lady Gakusho...!

18:43.780 --> 18:45.650
Hurry and get the medics!

18:47.520 --> 18:50.150
What...? What are you trying to say?!

18:55.800 --> 18:58.870
"The next day... \ D'natia territory

18:55.800 --> 18:58.870
Fort Rosweisse desert outskirts"

18:57.230 --> 18:59.400
A little farther until Fort Rosweisse.

18:59.400 --> 19:01.300
That means Ogani Volcano is close, too!

19:02.300 --> 19:05.710
--Ah...
--I'm sorry for that, everyone.

19:05.710 --> 19:08.700
I guess I'll have you feed me after all, Meryl.

19:11.480 --> 19:15.480
It seems like whatever tool
Sir Sweallow uses always breaks.

19:15.480 --> 19:16.850
It can't be...

19:16.850 --> 19:20.420
It's like a curse that I've had since I was a kid.

19:20.420 --> 19:22.020
I'm used to it by now.

19:22.020 --> 19:23.890
Since childhood?

19:23.890 --> 19:28.030
If it's a curse, don't you want to get rid of it?

19:28.030 --> 19:34.030
Well... In all honesty, I'd like to get rid of it, no matter what it takes.

19:34.030 --> 19:37.940
Could it be that you think your power is a curse, too, Ibuki?

19:37.940 --> 19:39.670
Ah, yes...

19:39.670 --> 19:41.280
That's why if there's a way to get rid--

19:41.280 --> 19:44.580
You can't be serious about letting such a wonderful power go to waste!

19:44.580 --> 19:46.880
Hey, now hold on there!

19:46.880 --> 19:53.090
Speaking of, we haven't heard anything about
Ibuki's power, but do you know something, Lou?

19:53.090 --> 19:54.220
How about you, Eykha?

19:54.220 --> 19:56.090
Excuse me.

19:56.090 --> 19:59.360
We decided to hurry ahead to Fort Rosweisse.

19:59.360 --> 20:01.400
I will leave my guards with you.

20:01.400 --> 20:04.600
That's fine, but did something happen?

20:04.600 --> 20:06.360
The Returned Ones...

20:07.870 --> 20:11.540
Villagers nearby escaped to the fort.

20:11.540 --> 20:13.470
They claimed that
Returned Ones had appeared.

20:13.470 --> 20:17.040
You mean this island's legend of the dead rising?

20:17.040 --> 20:20.110
Yes... I do believe it is a mistake, but...

20:20.110 --> 20:22.650
...I still need to investigate.

20:22.650 --> 20:24.140
Now, then.

20:39.300 --> 20:41.070
Stop it!

20:41.070 --> 20:43.470
I said stop!

20:51.010 --> 20:53.980
Could they be the Returned Ones...?!

21:05.290 --> 21:06.760
No!

21:06.760 --> 21:09.590
Ibuki! Sir Sweallow!

21:17.670 --> 21:19.660
Gakusho...?

21:27.510 --> 21:29.010
It can't be...

21:30.280 --> 21:32.220
She's a Returned One...?!

21:45.870 --> 21:46.330
"Act 5"

21:47.300 --> 21:50.570
"Act 5 \ In a Fog"

21:57.640 --> 22:02.880
<i>The end I thought I'd chosen;</i> <i>though the melody may warp (more)</i>

22:02.880 --> 22:07.850
<i>At last the pounding heartbeat</i> <i>desires it and performs</i>

22:07.850 --> 22:13.090
<i>Both the evened-out impulse</i> <i>and the wiped-out lament (now)</i>

22:13.090 --> 22:19.560
<i>Are wings that race onward,</i> <i>tearing through the fog</i>

22:32.910 --> 22:42.860
<i>Emotions that can't be hidden in words</i> <i>that push people away (bleeding through)</i>

22:42.860 --> 22:48.060
<i>Emptying both hands so I can get what I want</i>

22:48.060 --> 22:55.560
<i>If I can't even find fault</i> <i>with this unshrinking expanse</i>

22:56.770 --> 22:58.310
<i>What am I supposed to believe?</i>

22:58.310 --> 23:02.480
<i>I need nothing if I have you:</i>
<i>That alone is enough</i>

23:02.480 --> 23:12.480
<i>Go on and cry: You burn so bright because</i> <i>the gears of transmigration are turning</i>

23:12.620 --> 23:22.620
<i>Tightly spin together the intertwining roads</i> <i>to which your shouts led you</i>

23:26.900 --> 23:27.330
"Act 6"

23:27.130 --> 23:30.600
Act 6: "Six Paths of Transmigration."

23:30.600 --> 23:36.140
Yet again, a young man placing faith in ideals offers his life to Ibuki.

23:36.140 --> 23:40.270
Reunions are not always a blessing...
